> 
> * **Tier-1 核心函式掃描最末序號**：**#74** (絕對物理事實)
> * 分類小計：頂層函式 (A): **0** + 模組執行入口區塊 (B): **1** + 內部閉包 (C): **16** + 命名空間方法 (D): **57**
> * **內部閉包清單 (C 類, 16個)**：[`_init_on_main`, `_cancel_on_main`, `_do_show`, `_do_hide`, `_on_status_row_configure`, `_on_canvas_configure`, `_on_mousewheel`, `_bind_tab2_wheel`, `_unbind_tab2_wheel`, `_on_tab_changed`, `score_file`, `test_api_connection._worker`, `_classify_error`, `run_stage1_thread._worker`, `run_stage2_thread._worker`, `run_auto_pipeline._pipeline`]
> * **類別容器分組 (D 類, 57個)**：[Toast (1個): show + NovelRegexToolApp (56個): __init__, _on_closing, _norm_path_or_empty, _format_stopwatch_text, _start_stopwatch, _stopwatch_tick, _stop_stopwatch, _sleep_with_heartbeat, load_config, save_config, _warn_unsaved_path_diffs, build_top_bar, build_alert_banner, _show_alert_banner, _hide_alert_banner, get_account_display_labels, update_top_account_combo_values, on_top_account_selected, save_top_config, build_notebook, build_tab1, repack_bottom_bar, on_swap_bottom_bar_toggled, on_clear_and_paste_toggled, on_click_to_copy_toggled, handle_clear_log_action, reset_preview_headers, on_preview_box_click, build_tab2, refresh_strategy_cards, on_dispatch_mode_changed, on_retry_route_changed, browse_file, save_all_settings, set_ui_locked, update_status, parse_repair_dict_sections, detect_active_repair_sections, slice_repair_sections, validate_dict_syntax, stitch_repair_sections, resolve_prompt_path, get_dispatched_candidate_profiles, create_task_snapshot, raw_sdk_call, test_api_connection, call_gemini_api, read_file_content, run_stage1_thread, _exec_stage1, run_stage2_thread, _exec_stage2, run_auto_pipeline, _update_text_box, save_and_backup_dict, copy_qa_result = 57個]
> * **Tier-1 嚴格數學等式**：`0 (A) + 1 (B) + 16 (C) + 57 (D) = 74`（與表格末列序號 #74 100% 精準吻合）
